# Python

Target Python 3.12. Annotate public functions. Run Ruff and mypy on `src`.

Keep services synchronous. Use the sync SQLAlchemy session and sync httpx. Do not mix `asyncio.run` into request or worker code.

Datetimes are timezone-aware UTC. Convert campaign wall time with `zoneinfo` and IANA ids. Tests use `FrozenClock`, not `datetime.now()`.

Raise `ApiError` for expected API failures. Integration failures use `IntegrationError` or `AmbiguousPublishError`. Do not catch `Exception` and hide the kind of failure.

Every external HTTP call has a timeout from settings. Retries belong in the client and only for the cases that client documents.
